{title: 263 - Fire of God, Thou Sacred Flame}
{artist: Seventh-day Adventist Hymnal}
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: D}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{tag: Holy Spirit}
{tag: }

Verse 1:
[D/A]Fire [Em/B]of [A]God, [Bm/F#]Thou [Em]sacred [A]flame,
[A]Spirit who [D/A]in [A]splendor [G#m]came,
[D/A]Let [Em/B]Thy [A]heat [Bm/F#]my [G]soul refine
[A]Till [A7]it glows with [D/F#]love [Em/B]divine.

Verse 2:
[D/A]Breath of [Em/B]God, [A]that [Bm/F#]swept [Em]in [A]power
[A]In [G#m]the [A]pentecostal [G#m]hour,
[D/A]Holy [A]Breath, [Bm/F#]be [G]Thou in [D]me
[A]Source [A7]of vital [D/F#]energy.

Verse 3:
[D/A]Strength [Em/B]of [A]God, [Bm/F#]Thy [Em]might [A]within
[A]Conquers sorrow, pain, [G#m]and sin:
[D/A]Fortify [Bm/F#]from [G]evil's [D]art
[A]All [A7]the gateways [Em/B]of [A7/G]my [D/F#]heart.

Verse 4:
[D/A]Truth [Em/B]of [A]God, [Bm/F#]Thy [Em]piercing [D/A]rays
[A]Penetrate [D/A]my [A]secret [G#m]ways.
[D/A]May [Em/B]the [A]light [Bm/F#]that [G]shames [D]my [A]sin
[A]Guide [A7]me holier [D/F#]paths [Em/B]to [A7/G]win.

Verse 5:
[D/A]Love [Em/B]of [A]God, [Bm/F#]Thy [Em]grace [A]profound
[A]Knoweth neither age [G#m]nor bound:
[D/A]Come, [Em/B]my [A]heart's [Bm/F#]own [G]guest to [D]be,
[A]Dwell [A7]forevermore [Em/B]in [A7/G]me.
